  "name": "app.factshift.com",
  "description": "A modular interactive environment for graph-based conceptual modeling, leveraging D3.js to execute complex force-directed simulations within a multi-modal web interface. The system employs a custom domain-specific language (SPW) and a robust hotkey orchestration layer to manipulate topological constraints, node velocities, and semantic attributes in real-time. It integrates service workers for progressive enhancement and supports extensible 'superpower' modules for dynamic graph transformations and persistent state management.",
